00:49:29.680 --> 00:49:31.640
Tommy!

00:49:34.920 --> 00:49:37.880
Have you ever seen an unsuited body
compress in space?

00:49:42.080 --> 00:49:43.320
They freeze...

00:49:45.640 --> 00:49:48.320
and crack like a porcelain doll.

00:50:01.400 --> 00:50:04.080
I take my hat off to Daly. [sniffles]

00:50:04.600 --> 00:50:08.080
The detail in this place is exceptional.

00:50:11.760 --> 00:50:15.160
And he said he'd do it again and again,

00:50:15.720 --> 00:50:18.240
'cause Daly's still got Tommy's DNA.

00:50:18.320 --> 00:50:20.160
He's got all of our DNA.

00:50:20.800 --> 00:50:24.440
He keeps it in his bedroom
in a fucking mini fridge by his desk.

00:50:25.480 --> 00:50:28.560
So I have to stay in line,

00:50:29.440 --> 00:50:33.080
because even if we die in here,
he can bring us back.

00:50:33.160 --> 00:50:36.480
He can bring Tommy back
whenever he wants.

00:50:37.960 --> 00:50:40.160
And God knows how
he'd take it out on him.

00:50:42.280 --> 00:50:43.840
God knows what he'd do.

00:50:45.800 --> 00:50:49.840
So, you see, what choice do I have?

00:50:57.400 --> 00:50:58.440
Walton.

00:51:00.440 --> 00:51:03.480
We are gonna get that fucking lollipop.

00:51:03.560 --> 00:51:05.200
