00:56:36.720 --> 00:56:38.280
[phone vibrates]

00:56:40.560 --> 00:56:41.560
[gasps]

00:56:43.280 --> 00:56:44.280
Oh, my God.

00:56:45.880 --> 00:56:47.560
Elliott, you fucking asshole.

00:56:52.040 --> 00:56:53.360
[phone vibrates]

00:56:59.800 --> 00:57:00.640
