00:57:20.960 --> 00:57:22.240
[Nanette]<i> OK, yeah.</i>

00:57:22.320 --> 00:57:24.360
[stuttering]
I'll do what you want, anything.

00:57:25.280 --> 00:57:26.480
I'll do anything.

00:57:26.560 --> 00:57:28.360
