00:57:50.160 --> 00:57:53.280
I think I imagined it. [laughs] So stupid.

00:57:55.760 --> 00:57:57.040
[Daly] That's funny...

00:58:05.840 --> 00:58:09.160
-That's funny. [laughs]
-[Nanette] Yeah, it is funny. It's funny.

00:58:11.160 --> 00:58:12.680
