01:00:33.720 --> 01:00:35.640
-Hello?
<i></i>-Uh, pizza.

01:00:36.160 --> 01:00:37.240
<i>I didn't order a pizza.</i>

01:00:37.880 --> 01:00:40.760
<i>OK, look, someone did, OK?</i>
<i>So do you want it or not? Because...</i>

01:00:40.840 --> 01:00:43.080
<i>-I can't take it back.</i>
-[bag unzips]

01:00:47.960 --> 01:00:49.840
