01:01:20.040 --> 01:01:22.160
-Just fucking go.
-[engines revving]

01:01:27.440 --> 01:01:30.560
There you go.
So I got it here in under ten.

01:01:31.400 --> 01:01:33.520
There's supposed to be 30 in it for me.

01:01:33.600 --> 01:01:37.080
Yeah. What's happening?
The door is closing. Hello?

01:01:38.160 --> 01:01:40.160
<i>Hello? Hello?</i>

01:01:40.240 --> 01:01:41.680
[panting] Shit...

01:01:41.760 --> 01:01:42.800
<i>Come on, man.</i>

01:01:44.880 --> 01:01:47.320
<i>Hello? Come on, man, you promised.</i>

01:01:50.280 --> 01:01:51.760
[number pad beeps]

01:01:53.440 --> 01:01:54.440
[scoffs]

01:01:54.520 --> 01:01:57.080
-Nice. Nice. Merry Christmas, asshole!
-[thud]

01:01:59.080 --> 01:02:00.160
[scoffs]

01:02:00.760 --> 01:02:02.360
[muttering]

01:02:02.440 --> 01:02:05.320
[panting]

01:02:06.120 --> 01:02:08.120
[gasps]

01:02:38.800 --> 01:02:40.040
Resume game.

01:02:52.960 --> 01:02:54.560
Resume game.

01:03:01.240 --> 01:03:04.640
Can't we go any faster? That dud disk
