01:03:16.920 --> 01:03:20.640
Until Daly works out what's happening.
Then he'll find us and he'll fuck us over.

01:03:20.720 --> 01:03:22.760
[clattering]

01:03:35.800 --> 01:03:38.800
-Resume game.
-[device beeps]

01:03:40.400 --> 01:03:42.120
Lieutenant Cole, we should head...

01:03:44.000 --> 01:03:45.400
Cole?

01:03:48.440 --> 01:03:50.640
