01:04:20.440 --> 01:04:21.680
[engine revving]

01:04:45.280 --> 01:04:48.720
-<i>Ship's computer on.</i>
-Computer, where's the <i>USS Callister</i>?

01:04:48.800 --> 01:04:51.960
USS Callister<i> is on course.</i>

01:04:52.560 --> 01:04:54.840
-On course for where?
<i>-The wormhole.</i>

01:04:56.040 --> 01:04:58.880
-What wormhole?
<i>-The update vortex.</i>

01:05:01.680 --> 01:05:03.880
Sons of bitches!

01:05:08.080 --> 01:05:09.840
