<i>your insides out.</i>

01:06:28.440 --> 01:06:33.840
But I'll keep you alive
in tiny little jars

01:06:33.920 --> 01:06:35.720
<i>and there you'll stay</i>
<i>until I'm bored of you--</i>

01:06:35.800 --> 01:06:38.160
