-Yes, fuck him!

01:06:38.240 --> 01:06:39.240
[beeps]

01:06:39.320 --> 01:06:42.000
We're at the edge of the belt.
I think we're gonna make it.

01:06:45.200 --> 01:06:50.040
-[crashing]
-[alarm sounds]

01:06:52.960 --> 01:06:55.080
