01:07:32.640 --> 01:07:38.080
-[Dudani] We'd burn without dying.
-So one of us needs to go. OK.

01:07:38.840 --> 01:07:40.960
[Walton over speaker]
<i>One of us already has.</i>

01:07:41.040 --> 01:07:42.040
Walton?

01:07:42.120 --> 01:07:44.000
I'm pretty sure I can fix this.

01:07:44.080 --> 01:07:47.440
Um, uh... Walton, are you sure about this?

01:07:48.200 --> 01:07:49.800
