01:07:53.800 --> 01:07:55.320
[Tulaska]<i> Patching through.</i>

01:07:56.040 --> 01:07:58.600
[Walton panting]
<i>Hey, Daly, can you hear me?</i>

01:07:59.280 --> 01:08:02.240
-Walton?
<i>-Robert? Hey.</i>

01:08:02.320 --> 01:08:04.520
-Walton, you're going to pay for this.
-Robert, listen.

01:08:04.600 --> 01:08:06.520
<i>-I'm going to bring Tommy back in.</i>
-Hey, Robert--

01:08:06.600 --> 01:08:10.400
God so help me, you are going to regret
