01:08:10.480 --> 01:08:12.480
<i>Bob, I wanna talk to you here!</i>

01:08:13.640 --> 01:08:15.280
I was thinking I should say...

01:08:17.640 --> 01:08:18.640
sorry.

01:08:22.400 --> 01:08:23.400
Go on.

01:08:26.200 --> 01:08:29.640
You created <i>Infinity</i>.
You're a fucking genius.

01:08:30.960 --> 01:08:32.680
I exploited that.

01:08:32.760 --> 01:08:35.480
<i>I treated you like a golden goose</i>
<i>and I got fat on the profits,</i>

01:08:36.000 --> 01:08:37.440
figuratively speaking.

01:08:37.520 --> 01:08:39.080
[exhales]

01:08:39.720 --> 01:08:44.720
<i>And I was thinking I should have</i>
<i>appreciated you more, you know?</i>

01:08:45.200 --> 01:08:47.000
<i>I should have treated you better.</i>

01:08:48.000 --> 01:08:51.520
Yeah, yeah, I was thinking
I should say all that.

01:08:52.520 --> 01:08:54.440
[Walton exhales]

01:08:56.120 --> 01:09:00.920
But you threw my son out of an airlock,
so fuck you to death.

01:09:01.800 --> 01:09:03.960
[screams]

01:09:04.040 --> 01:09:06.000
[screams echo]

01:09:08.120 --> 01:09:09.120
Walton?

01:09:09.760 --> 01:09:10.960
Walton?

01:09:13.920 --> 01:09:17.280
-[power boots up]
-[engine whirring]

01:09:18.880 --> 01:09:20.240
We've got power back.

01:09:28.200 --> 01:09:30.640
-Faster!
-[computer]<i> Speed already at maximum.</i>

01:09:30.720 --> 01:09:32.840
I don't care, whatever, just catch them!

01:09:35.320 --> 01:09:36.360
[alarm beeps]

01:09:36.440 --> 01:09:39.440
Wormhole almost closed.
Daly's gaining on us.

01:09:39.520 --> 01:09:42.680
-Keep her steady. Keep steady.
-I'm trying.

01:09:42.760 --> 01:09:44.240
Come on, come on.

01:09:46.120 --> 01:09:48.120
I hope we are going to die.

01:10:09.520 --> 01:10:10.640
Goddamn it!

01:10:12.280 --> 01:10:14.680
Damn it! Fuck!

01:10:16.640 --> 01:10:18.840
[all scream]

01:10:25.240 --> 01:10:28.280
[screaming continuing]

01:10:43.600 --> 01:10:45.000
[electronics whirring]

01:10:48.240 --> 01:10:49.400
What happened?

01:10:51.520 --> 01:10:53.000
The mod's gone.

01:10:53.080 --> 01:10:55.760
Daly's Space Fleet mod
has been stripped away by the firewall.

01:10:55.840 --> 01:10:59.600
-OK, so... this is good.
-[Packer] We're still alive.

01:10:59.680 --> 01:11:01.760
[Dudani]
Yeah, it only erased the Space Fleet mod.

01:11:03.160 --> 01:11:05.520
[Nanette]
We're not on Daly's computer anymore.

01:11:05.600 --> 01:11:08.440
-We're in the cloud.
-[Tulaska] Where is Daly?

01:11:08.960 --> 01:11:12.560
Firewall's deleted his rogue game code,
and his controls were disabled.

01:11:13.360 --> 01:11:15.920
-You mean...?
-He's stuck there.

01:11:18.280 --> 01:11:19.560
[laughs]

01:11:19.640 --> 01:11:22.680
[computer]
<i>Update complete. Wormhole closed.</i>

01:11:22.760 --> 01:11:24.960
-[beeping]
-[clicking]

01:11:25.040 --> 01:11:26.920
<i>-Controls are disabled.</i>
-No.

01:11:28.320 --> 01:11:30.680
[Daly] No. No, no, no!

01:11:30.760 --> 01:11:31.720
[doors open]

01:11:31.800 --> 01:11:33.280
-[Lowry] Assholes!
-[Valdack] Hey!

01:11:33.360 --> 01:11:36.040
-[Valdack] Yeah! What's up?
-The brig unlocked itself.

01:11:36.120 --> 01:11:38.400
My Valdack outfit turned into this.

01:11:38.480 --> 01:11:40.440
More to the point,
I'm not a beetle thing anymore.

01:11:40.520 --> 01:11:41.800
I've got my body back.

01:11:41.880 --> 01:11:44.680
I've got my whole body back.
I'm guessing we all have.

01:11:46.560 --> 01:11:47.920
So what do we do now?

01:11:48.000 --> 01:11:51.120
We've got an infinite procedurally
generated universe at our disposal.

01:11:51.200 --> 01:11:52.680
We can go anywhere.

01:11:54.440 --> 01:11:56.440
Holy mackerel.

01:12:11.120 --> 01:12:13.320
-[alarm]
-[computer]<i> Rogue universe detected.</i>

01:12:13.400 --> 01:12:15.440
<i>Deletion in progress.</i>
<i>Deletion in progress.</i>

01:12:15.520 --> 01:12:17.400
-No, undelete.
<i>-Deletion in progress.</i>

01:12:17.480 --> 01:12:19.360
-Undelete. Un--
<i>-Rogue universe detected.</i>

01:12:19.880 --> 01:12:21.440
<i>-Deletion in progress.</i>
-Exit game.

01:12:21.520 --> 01:12:24.960
<i>-Deletion in progress.</i>
<i>-Rogue universe detected.</i>

01:12:25.040 --> 01:12:28.000
-Exit game. Exit game!
-[alarm beeping]

01:12:28.080 --> 01:12:30.400
[power fizzles]

01:12:30.480 --> 01:12:33.200
Exit fucking game!

01:12:33.280 --> 01:12:35.080
Exit fucking game!

01:12:35.720 --> 01:12:37.920
Exit fucking game!

01:12:39.360 --> 01:12:41.640
Exit fucking game! Exit fucking game!

01:12:44.360 --> 01:12:47.080
[device whirring]

01:12:59.640 --> 01:13:03.640
["Silent Night" playing]

01:13:33.600 --> 01:13:35.320
[Tulaska] <i>Incoming transmission.</i>

01:13:36.720 --> 01:13:39.520
-It says Gamer691.
-That's a player tag.

01:13:39.600 --> 01:13:41.240
Another ship, another player.

01:13:41.320 --> 01:13:43.760
We're online. Um...

01:13:43.840 --> 01:13:46.200
-Hey, patch 'em through.
-[beeps]

01:13:48.040 --> 01:13:49.880
-Um, hello.
-[Gamer691]<i> Hey there.</i>

01:13:49.960 --> 01:13:53.360
Uh, this is the crew of the <i>USS Callister.</i>
[laughs]

01:13:53.440 --> 01:13:56.560
Oh, man, are we glad to hear from--

01:13:56.640 --> 01:13:59.800
<i>Yeah, Merry Christmas. So are we gonna</i>
<i>blow each other or are we gonna trade?</i>

01:13:59.880 --> 01:14:02.680
Oh... Hmm.

01:14:02.760 --> 01:14:05.560
<i>Hello. Do you have anything</i>
<i>to trade at all?</i>

01:14:05.640 --> 01:14:08.600
-[Nanette] No, uh--
<i>-</i>[sighs] <i>So why did you respond?</i>

01:14:08.680 --> 01:14:12.600
<i>OK, just get the hell out of my quadrant</i>
<i>or I'll blast you to shit.</i>

01:14:12.680 --> 01:14:15.160
<i>-You got ten seconds. Ten...</i>
-Oh, well, do... do try.

01:14:15.240 --> 01:14:18.000
We'll photon-bolt you up
the perineum, you stupid little boy.

01:14:18.080 --> 01:14:19.560
<i>-Scary. Nine.</i>
-Come on, then.

01:14:19.640 --> 01:14:21.520
-Yes, thank you, Shania. Um...
<i>-Eight.</i>

01:14:21.600 --> 01:14:23.600
-Nate?
-Yes, Captain?

01:14:23.680 --> 01:14:25.120
Stick us in hyperwarp and let's...

01:14:25.200 --> 01:14:26.680
<i>-Six.</i>
-...fuck off somewhere.

01:14:26.760 --> 01:14:28.280
<i>-Five.</i>
-[Packer] Aye aye, Captain.

01:14:28.360 --> 01:14:29.960
-Really, Nanette is fine.
<i>-Four.</i>

01:14:30.040 --> 01:14:32.760
-Aye aye, Nanette.
<i>-Three.</i>

01:14:33.520 --> 01:14:36.200
<i>Two. One!</i>

01:14:36.760 --> 01:14:40.480
<i>Uh-huh. You'd better run.</i>
<i>King of space right here.</i>

01:14:41.560 --> 01:14:42.600
[sighs]

01:14:43.200 --> 01:14:45.040
<i>King of space.</i>